{
  "name": "cad-preview",
  "displayName": "CAD Preview",
  "description": "Interactive 3D preview, non-destructive editing, and FE mesh generation for CAD and mesh files (STEP, IGES, BREP, STL, OBJ, PLY, glTF, VTK, MED, CGNS, and more) inside VS Code, with an MCP server for AI agents.",
  "version": "3.42.0",
  "publisher": "kratos-multiphysics",
  "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later",
  "icon": "images/icon.png",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/loumalouomega/CAD-Preview.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.144.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Visualization",
    "Other"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "customEditors": [
      {
        "viewType": "cad-preview.mesh",
        "displayName": "CAD Preview",
        "selector": [
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.stl"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.obj"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.ply"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.gltf"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.glb"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.3mf"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.dae"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.amf"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.usd"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.usda"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.usdc"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.usdz"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.wrl"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.fbx"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.step"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.stp"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.iges"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.igs"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.brep"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.csg"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.scad"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.vtk"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.vtu"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.med"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.cgns"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.exo"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.e"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xdmf"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.mdpa"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.foam"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.msh"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.msh2"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.inp"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.unv"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.su2"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.mesh"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.post.msh"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xda"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xdr"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xda.gz"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xda.bz2"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.cad.json"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.bdf"
          }
        ],
        "priority": "default"
      }
    ],
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "cad-preview",
          "title": "CAD Preview",
          "icon": "images/activity-icon.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "cad-preview": [
        {
          "id": "cad-preview.models",
          "name": "Models"
        }
      ]
    },
    "walkthroughs": [
      {
        "id": "cad-preview.welcome",
        "title": "Get started with CAD Preview",
        "description": "Open a model, edit it, mesh it and connect an agent.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "open",
            "title": "Open a model",
            "description": "Open a STEP, IGES, BREP, STL, OBJ, PLY, glTF or FE-mesh file, or copy a bundled sample into a folder.\n[Open CAD File…](command:cad-preview.open)\n[Open Sample…](command:cad-preview.openSample)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/open.md"
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onCommand:cad-preview.open",
              "onCommand:cad-preview.openSample"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "edit",
            "title": "Edit and save",
            "description": "Edits are stored beside the file in a sidecar; the source is written only when you save.\n[Show What's New](command:cad-preview.whatsNew)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/edit.md"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "mesh",
            "title": "Generate a mesh",
            "description": "Use the FE Mesh panel to mesh a B-rep or a surface mesh with Gmsh, and export it for a solver.",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/mesh.md"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "agent",
            "title": "Connect an agent",
            "description": "The bundled MCP server lets an agent inspect, edit and mesh the same models.\n[Connect an agent…](command:cad-preview.connectAgent)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "media/walkthrough/agent.md"
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onCommand:cad-preview.connectAgent"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "viewsWelcome": [
      {
        "view": "cad-preview.models",
        "contents": "No CAD models found in this workspace.\n[Open CAD File…](command:cad-preview.open)\n[New Blank Model…](command:cad-preview.new)\n[Open Sample…](command:cad-preview.openSample)"
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.open",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Open File…",
        "icon": "$(folder-opened)"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.new",
        "title": "CAD Preview: New Blank Model…",
        "icon": "$(new-file)"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.openSample",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Open Sample…",
        "icon": "$(library)"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.refreshModels",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Refresh Models",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.save",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Save"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.saveAs",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Save As / Export…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.export",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Export…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.savePreprocess",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Save Preprocess (.zip)…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.loadPreprocess",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Load Preprocess (.zip)…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.reportIssue",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Report Issue…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.whatsNew",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Show What's New"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.screenshot",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Screenshot to PNG…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.exportSvg",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Export Silhouette SVG…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.exportDxf",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Export Silhouette DXF…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.exportDrawing",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Export Technical Drawing…",
        "category": "CAD Preview"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.exportSheet",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Export Drawing Sheet…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.exportMesh",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Export FE Mesh…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.zoomToSelection",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Zoom to Selection"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.compareModels",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Compare Models…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.batchExport",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Batch Export…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.prepReport",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Preparation Report…"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.spaceMouseConnect",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Connect SpaceMouse"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.spaceMouseDisconnect",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Disconnect SpaceMouse"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.connectAgent",
        "title": "CAD Preview: Connect an agent…"
      }
    ],
    "mcpServerDefinitionProviders": [
      {
        "id": "cad-preview.mcp",
        "label": "CAD Preview"
      }
    ],
    "keybindings": [
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.open",
        "key": "ctrl+o",
        "mac": "cmd+o",
        "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.saveAs",
        "key": "ctrl+shift+s",
        "mac": "cmd+shift+s",
        "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.export",
        "key": "ctrl+e",
        "mac": "cmd+e",
        "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.savePreprocess",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+s",
        "mac": "cmd+alt+s",
        "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.loadPreprocess",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+o",
        "mac": "cmd+alt+o",
        "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
      },
      {
        "command": "cad-preview.screenshot",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+p",
        "mac": "cmd+alt+p",
        "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.save",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.saveAs",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.export",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.savePreprocess",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.screenshot",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.exportSvg",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.exportDxf",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.exportDrawing",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.exportSheet",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.exportMesh",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.zoomToSelection",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'cad-preview.mesh'"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.refreshModels",
          "when": "view == cad-preview.models"
        }
      ],
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.open",
          "when": "view == cad-preview.models",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.refreshModels",
          "when": "view == cad-preview.models",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "cad-preview.new",
          "when": "view == cad-preview.models",
          "group": "navigation@3"
        }
      ],
      "view/item/context": [
        {
          "command": "revealInExplorer",
          "when": "view == cad-preview.models",
          "group": "2_files@1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "CAD Preview",
      "properties": {
        "cadPreview.background": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "#1e1e1e",
          "description": "Default 3D view background color (CSS hex) for newly opened models."
        },
        "cadPreview.defaultMeshSizePreset": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "coarse",
            "medium",
            "fine"
          ],
          "default": "medium",
          "description": "Default FE mesh element-size preset seeded for models with no saved .mesh.json sidecar."
        },
        "cadPreview.showGridAndAxesOnOpen": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Show the ground grid and axes helper when a model is opened."
        },
        "cadPreview.openscadBinary": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "openscad",
          "description": "Fallback OpenSCAD binary used when the bundled OpenSCAD WASM declines a .scad source (import()/surface(), missing includes, over the staging caps). Ordinary models need no install — they convert in the kernel worker with nothing on PATH. Resolved via PATH when bare. Wins over the OPENSCAD_BINARY environment variable, the headless (MCP server) escape hatch. Unused when no .scad file is opened."
        },
        "cadPreview.openscadBackend": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "auto",
            "cgal",
            "manifold"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Pass no backend flag: whatever the installed OpenSCAD defaults to. Works with every OpenSCAD release.",
            "Force the CGAL engine (--backend=cgal). The long-standing default; slower on large boolean trees.",
            "Force the Manifold engine (--backend=manifold): much faster booleans, but needs a recent (2025+) OpenSCAD snapshot."
          ],
          "default": "auto",
          "description": "Geometry engine OpenSCAD evaluates .scad sources with. Leave on auto unless your OpenSCAD supports --backend. Headless twin: the OPENSCAD_BACKEND environment variable (cgal or manifold). Unused when no .scad file is opened."
        },
        "cadPreview.openscadLibraryPaths": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "default": [],
          "description": "Extra OpenSCAD library folders (BOSL2, MCAD, ...) prepended to OPENSCADPATH for the conversion only, so `use <BOSL2/std.scad>` resolves without copying libraries beside every model. Absolute paths. Unused when no .scad file is opened."
        },
        "cadPreview.kernelTimeoutMinutes": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 5,
          "minimum": 0.1,
          "maximum": 120,
          "markdownDescription": "Watchdog for a single kernel job (load, mesh, export…). A job running longer is killed and the kernel worker respawned. Applies to newly opened documents."
        },
        "cadPreview.tessellationQuality": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "draft",
            "standard",
            "fine"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Coarser, faster tessellation — larger triangles, less detail on curved surfaces.",
            "The default: unchanged from previous versions of this extension.",
            "Finer, slower tessellation — smaller triangles, more detail on curved surfaces."
          ],
          "default": "standard",
          "description": "B-rep tessellation quality (STEP/IGES/BREP sources). Re-read on every edit, so a change takes effect on the next edit without reopening the file. Does not affect FE mesh generation (see the FE Mesh panel's own size settings)."
        },
        "cadPreview.upAxis": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "y",
            "z"
          ],
          "default": "y",
          "description": "Default up-axis orientation for newly opened models."
        },
        "cadPreview.navigationPreset": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "default",
            "fusion",
            "touchpad"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Left-drag orbits, middle-drag zooms, right-drag pans.",
            "Fusion-style: middle-drag pans, Shift+middle-drag orbits; the left button is free for selection.",
            "Trackpad: left-drag orbits, a two-finger scroll pans, a pinch zooms. A physical mouse wheel sends the same plain scroll events, so it pans too."
          ],
          "default": "default",
          "description": "How the mouse and trackpad navigate the 3D view. The wheel zooms, except under the Touchpad preset where a plain scroll pans and a pinch (Ctrl-wheel) zooms. Applied when a viewer opens or the setting changes for new viewers."
        },
        "cadPreview.ribbon": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Show the ribbon (the tabbed command strip under the menu bar) when a viewer opens. Hiding or showing it in a document is remembered in that model's .view.json sidecar and wins over this setting. Read when a viewer opens."
        },
        "cadPreview.singleKeyCommands": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "Enable single-letter command keys in the viewer: E Extrude, R Revolve, F Fillet, C Chamfer, H Hole, M Move, S Shell, P Linear Pattern, Q Measure mode, and Shift+R to repeat the last command (reopens its form with the last values, without applying). Off by default because single keys collide with typing habits; they never fire while focus is in a text field and never replace the view snaps (1-6, i). Ctrl+K (or / outside a field) opens the command search regardless of this setting. Read when a viewer opens."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "tsc --noEmit",
    "build": "node esbuild.mjs && npm run compile",
    "watch": "node esbuild.mjs --watch",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "package": "vsce package",
    "reinstall": "bash scripts/reinstall-local.sh",
    "mcp": "node dist/mcp-server.js",
    "mcp:smoke": "npm run build && node scripts/mcp-smoke/run.mjs",
    "perf": "npm run build && node scripts/perf/run.mjs",
    "probe": "node scripts/probe/run.mjs",
    "test:webview": "npm run build && node scripts/screenshots/make-fixtures.mjs && node scripts/webview-test/run.mjs",
    "test:integration": "npm run build && node test/integration/run.mjs",
    "compat": "npm run build && node scripts/compat/run.mjs",
    "compat:vsix": "node scripts/compat/vsix-check.mjs",
    "docs:dev": "vitepress dev doc",
    "ui:drift": "node scripts/ui-drift-check.mjs",
    "docs:build": "vitepress build doc",
    "docs:preview": "vitepress preview doc",
    "docs:screenshots": "npm run build && node scripts/screenshots/make-fixtures.mjs && node scripts/screenshots/capture.mjs"
  },
